    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>Online Ready is an online safety course licensed to schools on a per-seat basis. A "seat" is one student access code, valid for one academic year from the date it's issued unless agreed otherwise.</p>

    <h2>Pricing and payment</h2>
    <p>Seats are priced at £1 per student per year unless a whole-school flat rate has been agreed separately. An invoice is issued on request and is due within <em>[30/40 days — confirm final payment term]</em> of the invoice date, payable by bank transfer (BACS).</p>

    <h2>Access during a payment dispute</h2>
    <p>If an invoice becomes overdue, we won't cut off students mid-course. We'll get in touch with the school's finance contact to resolve it directly before any access is affected.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Access codes are for use by the licensing school's own students only, and shouldn't be shared outside that school or resold.</p>

    <h2>Cancellations and refunds</h2>
